# mod-auto-loot: a skinner skins his own kills in passing (operator 2026-10-29: skinning "automatisch").
# Before, the creature branch stripped the skinnable flag of every looted corpse, so skinners got nothing.
# A solo bot with Skinning 450 and a Skinning Knife kills a Loch Frenzy (1193, skinning loot: Shiny Fish
# Scales 17057 at 100 %) at a natural spawn in Loch Modan; the scales end up in its bags.
name    Auto loot - a skinner's own kill is skinned in passing
timeout 60s

bot k warrior slot=6
group none

place 0 -4806.0 -3347.0 287.1 0
require k alive
do gm target k
as gm .learn 8613
as gm .setskill 393 450 450
as gm .additem 7005
pick f creature:1193 near k alive
require f exists
# the director has auto-loot too: out of reach
do gm goto -4806.0 -3387.0 287.1
do k approach f
do k attack f
waitfor f dead timeout 25s
waitfor k item 17057 >= 1 timeout 5s

cleanup
do k stop
do k destroy 17057
do k destroy 7005
do gm target k
as gm .unlearn 8613
